(37, 0, 63, 0, '|biomolecular|hospital-clinic|cosmetic|dairy|food|general-purpose|pharmaceutical|water|', 'Hand Dispenser', '', '', '<p><strong>Descriptions</strong></p>\r\n<p>The hand dispenser is a small size portable device. It can start/stop the pump and start dispensing. Built-in indicator shows the working status.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Applicable Tubing</strong>:13# 14# 19# 16# 25# 15#<br /><strong>Function</strong>: start/stop, start dispensing<br /><strong>Color</strong>: black<br /><strong>Interface</strong>: DB15<br /><strong>Standard length of signal cable</strong>: 1m (3 ft)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>For inquiry please kindly email to : lisa@prolabios.com</strong></p>', 1, '52bf251f8d563ae5867d8cdaf3670b04.jpg', 0, 0, '2020-02-24 22:48:52', '', '', '', 0),
(38, 0, 63, 0, '|biomolecular|hospital-clinic|cosmetic|dairy|food|pharmaceutical|water|', 'Anti adsorption countersunk', '', '', '<p><strong>Desriptions</strong></p>\r\n<p>Use at the pipe outlet to prevent the pump tube floating or suction in the container wall, the body is made of stainless steel, available in various sizes.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Specification</strong></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 63.1604%; height: 126px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.3081%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Material</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.3192%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Laboratory type</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.9643%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Industry type</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.3081%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">Stainless steel</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.3192%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">13# 14#</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.9643%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.3081%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">Stainless steel</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.3192%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">16#</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.9643%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.3081%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">Stainless steel</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.3192%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">15# 25#</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.9643%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.3081%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">Stainless steel</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.3192%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">17# 24#</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.9643%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.3081%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">Stainless steel</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.3192%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">18# 35# 36#</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.9643%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.3081%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">Stainless steel</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.3192%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.9643%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">\r\n<div align=\"center\">73# 82#</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>For inquiry please kindly email to : lisa@prolabios.com</strong></p>', 1, '5589d0c6a6647dfd2ac822ab174ba1f5.jpg', 0, 0, '2020-02-24 22:57:26', '', '', '', 0),
(39, 0, 63, 0, '|biomolecular|hospital-clinic|cosmetic|dairy|food|general-purpose|pharmaceutical|water|', 'Dispensing Needles', '', '', '<p>Dispensing Needles is designed for liquid dispensing and anti-dropping, it can be directly applied by hand, it can be equipped with LeadFluid handheld dispenser, simple fillingstation or self-supporting fixing bracket.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>For inquiry please kindly email to : lisa@prolabios.com</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, '6680ef28d1d15a869eb937c62587b466.jpg', 0, 0, '2020-02-24 23:04:39', '', '', '', 0),
(40, 0, 63, 0, '|biomolecular|hospital-clinic|cosmetic|dairy|food|general-purpose|pharmaceutical|water|', 'TubeFiller', '', '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">TubeFiller is designed to reduce repetitive manual filling of any format laboratory racked tubes.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Based on its dedicated function to fill â€œany tubes in any rackâ€ the design includes a very stable filling arm with 2 side rails for best position recovery, precise XY position axes, an easy manual height adjustment, and an integrated pump to cover the standard microbiology filling range. No need for an additional pump for standard applications.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Especially appreciated by our customers; under the tubes there is stainless steel only! Easy to clean, no rims or gaps and therefore Microbiology friendly and optimal for Food-, Pharma- or Cosmetic- Lab environments.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Suitable for any rack from small 96 well format, typical Microbiology racks holding high glass tubes, up to customized beaker/ bottle holders or any other regular racked lab containments can become filled.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The software allows simplest setup of XY oriented tube racks. The racks are stored in a library. Any new rack setup of the filling platform can be programmed via the rack drag & drop menu. The integrated laser tracking allows definition of exact rack position by checking the first and the last tube in the rack.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The variable rack frame allows the exact repositioning of racks. For repetitive routine applications customer design frames guarantee exact rack positions and process optimized high throughput filling applications.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Designed to its â€œfill-only-applicationâ€, the TubeFiller is a cost effective filling solution. <strong>Made by microbiologists for microbiologists!</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Tube filling - rapid and easy</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Allows free positioning of any rack</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Intuitive programmable software</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Integrated pump</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>True walk away tube/bottle filling</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>2100 cm<sup>2</sup> free usable surface</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Accommodates widest range of any rack from 96-shallow well format to tall tubes and even bottles up to 25cm</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><img title=\"specification TubeFiller\" src=\"/content/photo/2063d6721c5f4602f504ebbcaab6aaad.jpg\" alt=\"specification TubeFiller\" width=\"414\" height=\"328\" /></p>\r\n<p><strong>Software & Performance</strong></p>\r\n<p>1000 tubes 5ml/Filling Speed DosiPump DP1000</p>\r\n<p>Software requires WIN 7 or higher, 100 MB disk space, min 4 MB RAM, WXGA Net Framework 4</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/content/photo/f4c8f3371ef71344deb56424d08cb847.jpg\" width=\"248\" height=\"246\" /></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 60.3793%; height: 111px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.4713%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Catalogue</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.6537%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Descriptions</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.25425%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>UoM</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.4713%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\">970000</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.6537%; height: 18px;\">TubeFiller TF3000 complete*</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.25425%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 pc</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.4713%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\">970001</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.6537%; height: 18px;\">TubeFiller TF3000 base unit</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.25425%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 pc</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.4713%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\">970101</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.6537%; height: 18px;\">TubeFiller PC Software, CD Version</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.25425%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 pc</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 21px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.4713%; text-align: center; height: 21px;\">970222</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.6537%; height: 21px;\">Positioning grid, aluminum, 3X+3Y variable rods</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.25425%; height: 21px; text-align: center;\">1 pc</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.4713%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\">970114</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 37.6537%; height: 18px;\">Silicone tubing set with filling needle 1</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.25425%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 pc</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>* Integrated peristaltic pump, Windows-compatible Software on CD-ROM (WIN 7 or higher), Tubing 3*7 mm, filling needle 4mm<br /><br /></p>\r\n<p><strong>For inquiry please kindly email to : lisa@prolabios.com</strong></p>\r\n<p>Â </p>\r\n<p>Â </p>\r\n<p>Â </p>', 1, '41f2cb49a2ce37f1708b4a650164e01e.jpg', 0, 0, '2020-02-24 23:16:22', '', '', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `crm_product` (`product_id`, `product_parent_id`, `channel_id`, `vendor_id`, `sector`, `product_name`, `product_size`, `product_unit`, `product_description`, `product_status`, `product_image`, `product_price`, `product_stock`, `product_post`, `product_features`, `product_spec`, `product_option`, `ispromo`) VALUES
(41, 0, 63, 0, '|biomolecular|hospital-clinic|cosmetic|dairy|food|general-purpose|pharmaceutical|', 'FlexiRoll & FlexiRock\'N\'Roll', '', '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The BioTool FlexiRoll is a compact digital cell roller for use with a variety of bottles, tubes and flasks.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Applications include growth and culturing of adherent cells, suspension cells, mixing blood or vacutainer TM tubes, washing nucleic acid blots or performing hybridization protocols.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ideal for use on a benchtop or in a CO2 incubator; can be safely operated in temperatures ranging from 4&deg; - 60&deg;C and atmospheric environments of up to 95% humidity. The FlexiRoll operates from .5 &ndash; 80 rpm and offers a timer function when used with the digital remote controller.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The six included rollers will accommodate three large (850 cm<sup>2</sup>) roller bottles.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The FlexiRoll can also be used in Western, Southern or Northern blotting applications as an alternative to the more expensive rotisserie style hybridization ovens. By purchasing five additional rollers the FlexiRoll can rotate 20 &ndash; 15 &amp; 50mL tubes at one time, ensuring a complete and uniform mixing of the reagents with the filter paper.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">To maximize bench space the FlexiRoll can be stacked into a two tiered unit to provide additional roller bottle capacity. By inserting the anodized aluminum legs the second unit rests on top of the first allowing six rollers bottles to be cultured at a time. Each stacked unit is independently controlled to allow for speed variation.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Digital Cell Roller:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>From +4 &ndash; 60&deg;C</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cold to CO2 incubator</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Digital remote control</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Variable speed control</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Rolling and rocking movement</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>2x stackable for additional capacity</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Accommodates up to 3 Roller Bottles</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ideal for hybridization, Western, Northern &amp; Southern Blots, cell culture roller bottles</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The digital remote controller is useful for applications where the FlexiRoll unit is placed in a CO2 incubator or another closed environment.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img title=\"remote\" src=\"/content/photo/0d175950f7d4fd7cd0117753a45b6269.jpg\" alt=\"remote\" width=\"86\" height=\"110\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">A digital key pad on the unit provides control of the time and speed settings of the FlexiRoll without having to open the incubator door.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The FlexiRoll allows you to enter the chamber to handle your cells rather than the equipment.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 240px;\"><img title=\"FlexiRoll\" src=\"/content/photo/59fac0f6133616ba92d27650e3e07539.jpg\" alt=\"FlexiRoll\" width=\"116\" height=\"193\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Dimensions:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bench top: 5.4 kg, 42x44x7(33) cm</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Packed : 6.0 kg, 50x48x18 cm</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Items</strong></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 69.6523%; height: 108px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.8585%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Catalogue</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8824%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Descriptions</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.3769%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><strong>UoM</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.8585%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.R1000E</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8824%; height: 18px;\">FlexiRoll 220V, complete</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.3769%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 pcs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.8585%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.R1100&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8824%; height: 18px;\">Cell roller rods (6) for FlexiRoll</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.3769%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">6 pcs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.8585%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.R1103</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8824%; height: 18px;\">Cell roller rods (6) for Flexi Rock n&rsquo;Roll, off-centered axis</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.3769%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">6 pcs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.8585%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.R1102</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8824%; height: 18px;\">O-ring (incl. 20x 15 &amp; 20x 50ml) 40/pack</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.3769%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">40 pcs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.8585%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.R1205</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.8824%; height: 18px;\">Stacking rods 4/pack</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.3769%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">4 pcs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>For inquiry please kindly email to : lisa@prolabios.com</strong></p>', 1, '24f5b777a35899784bcc8eb877130f46.jpg', 0, 0, '2020-02-24 23:40:35', '', '', '', 0),
(42, 0, 63, 0, '|biomolecular|hospital-clinic|cosmetic|dairy|food|general-purpose|pharmaceutical|water|', 'OmegaPlus Pipettor  ', '', '', '<p>The <strong>OMEGA</strong> Plus Pipettor is lightweight, ergonomic, UV resistant serological pipettor for accurate reproducible filling and dispensing of glass and plastic pipettes from 1 - 100mL.</p>\r\n<p>The perfect combination of single-handed pipetting with fast, precise liquid dispensing: The aspirating and dispensing speeds can be continuously adjusted with one hand using the thumb dial. Touch sensitive contoured buttons enable precise filling and dispensing with one hand.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Personalize it !</strong> The unit in your preferred color: blue, green, red, purple or transparent.</p>\r\n<p>The OMEGA&trade; Pipettor has rechargeable 6.5V lithium ion battery that will provide 10 hours of continuous use. The housing can be opened to replace old battery by the user. Unique five bar LED display indicates battery strength and when to recharge.</p>\r\n<p><img title=\"Omega 2\" src=\"/content/photo/3795907313ece66cd6bf873c00b54f42.jpg\" alt=\"Omega 2\" width=\"192\" height=\"90\" /></p>\r\n<p>Overfilling and contamination are prevented by a 0.45&micro;m hydrophobic filter located in the autoclavable nosecone.</p>\r\n<p>The unit is supplied with 6.5V lithium ion battery, 220V, 50Hz adapter, spare 0.45&micro;m filter, wall mount, utility knife and spare I.D. labels.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ergonomic &amp; Light</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li><strong>Light weight</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>0.45 &micro;m safety filter</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Speed adjusting wheel</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Ergonomic touch buttons</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Fast &amp; long lasting charging</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Power charging LED indicator</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><img title=\"Omega 3\" src=\"/content/photo/f79c6858648698d5a394bc54385f8319.jpg\" alt=\"Omega 3\" width=\"218\" height=\"176\" /></p>\r\n<p>Ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Laboratories</li>\r\n<li>Research and development</li>\r\n<li>Chemical industry</li>\r\n<li>Pharmaceutical industry</li>\r\n<li>Hospitals</li>\r\n<li>Food industry, agro</li>\r\n<li>Universities, etc</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Dimensions:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Bench top: 0.19 kg, 15x14x4 cm</li>\r\n<li>Packed: 0.72 kg, 15x24x8 cm</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Items</strong></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 71.4436%; height: 162px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1573%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\"><strong>Catalogue</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.5504%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\"><strong>Descriptions</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.7358%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\"><strong>UoM</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1573%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.P5015</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.5504%; height: 18px;\">Omega PLUS Green</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.7358%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 pcs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1573%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.P5016</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.5504%; height: 18px;\">Omega PLUS Red</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.7358%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 pcs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1573%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.P5017</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.5504%; height: 18px;\">Omega PLUS Blue</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.7358%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 pcs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1573%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.P5018</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.5504%; height: 18px;\">Omega PLUS Clear</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.7358%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 pcs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1573%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.P5019</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.5504%; height: 18px;\">Omega PLUS Purple</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.7358%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 pcs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1573%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.P1020</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.5504%; height: 18px;\">Silicone pipettor mount for pipettes 0.1 ml - 50 ml</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.7358%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 pcs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1573%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.153016</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.5504%; height: 18px;\">Filter, non-sterile, pore size 0.45 &micro;m</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.7358%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">10 pcs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.1573%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.P3225</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 39.5504%; height: 18px;\">Rubber filter interface</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 15.7358%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 pcs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>For inquiry please kindly email to : lisa@prolabios.com</strong></p>', 1, 'f1ba0dd0918aa9741606cf9b4ef2f799.jpg', 0, 0, '2020-02-25 00:00:48', '', '', '', 0),
(43, 0, 63, 0, '|biomolecular|', 'RotoFlex & RotoFlex Plus', '', '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The BioTool RotoFlex is a compact tube rotation device for use with a variety of tubes.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The RotoFlex will accommodate a variety of tubes from 1.5 &ndash; 50ml by simply changing the rotisserie. No tools are required ! The mixing angle can be adjusted from 0-90&deg; and each of the 4 tube panel can be aligned independently. The 360&deg; rotation ensures thorough mixing of all samples at the same time while rotating at 22 rpm.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">To change the rotation direction &ndash; simply touch the rotisserie paddle while in motion and the RotoFlex automatically begins to rotate in the opposite direction.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">RotoFlex Plus has the additional feature of digital display, variable speed from 10-40rpm and oscillating mode at 40&deg; rotation, controlled by an easy keypad. Optional there is a magnetic platform to optimize Western Blot hybridization. Simply attach your plastic bag, containing membrane &amp; antibody solution with the metal strips provided.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">RotoFlex and RotoFlex Plus can be used in incubators and cold room settings. The unit is supplied complete with base unit and rotisseries (1 pack of each size).</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Tube Rotation Device</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Accommodates tubes from 0.5 &ndash; 50ml</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ideal for sample mixing, hybridization, Western</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Northern &amp; Southern Blots.</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Fixed speed at 22rpm (RotoFlex).</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Variable speed control from 10 &ndash; 40 rpm (Plus).</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Oscillating mode (RotoFlex Plus).</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Easy-to-clean.</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>For use from +4&deg;C to 36&deg;C.</strong></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Small foot-print takes up less bench space.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Ideal for:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Sample mixing / re-suspension</li>\r\n<li>Hybridization</li>\r\n<li>DNA Purification</li>\r\n<li>Protein binding</li>\r\n<li>Immuno-precipitation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Dimensions:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Bench top: 1.1 kg, 26x15x19 cm</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Items</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 77.6607%; height: 198px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.0499%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\"><strong>Catalogue</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.0898%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\"><strong>Descriptions</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.5209%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\"><strong>UoM</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.0499%; height: 36px; text-align: center;\">AG.R2001</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.0898%; height: 36px;\">RotoFlex 220V, complete system, with 1 pack/each size of Rotisseries</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.5209%; height: 36px; text-align: center;\">1 ea</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.0499%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.R2201</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.0898%; height: 18px;\">RotoFlex Plus 220V, complete system</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.5209%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 ea</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.0499%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.R2012</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.0898%; height: 18px;\">Magnetic platform for RotoFlex Plus, Metal strips incl. (4)</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.5209%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 ea</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.0499%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.R2013</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.0898%; height: 18px;\">Metal strips for magnetic plate for RotoFlex Plus, 4/pk</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.5209%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">4 pk</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.0499%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.R2002</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.0898%; height: 18px;\">Rotisserie for 0.5 - 0.8ml tubes (21 tubes)</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.5209%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">2 pk</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.0499%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.R2003</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.0898%; height: 18px;\">Rotisserie for 1.5 - 2ml tubes (15 tubes)</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.5209%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">2 pk</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.0499%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.R2004</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.0898%; height: 18px;\">Rotisserie for 5 - 7ml tubes (7 tubes)</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.5209%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">2 pk</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.0499%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.R2005</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.0898%; height: 18px;\">Rotisserie for 10 - 15ml tubes (7 tubes)</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.5209%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">2 pk</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.0499%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.R2006</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 52.0898%; height: 18px;\">Rotisserie for 50ml tubes (6 tubes)</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 11.5209%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">2 pk</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>For inquiry please kindly emai