(44, 0, 63, 0, '|biomolecular|hospital-clinic|cosmetic|dairy|food|general-purpose|pharmaceutical|water|', 'FlexiRack Pipetting Workstation ', '', '', '<ul>\r\n<li>Versatile polypropylene rack</li>\r\n<li>Modular design</li>\r\n<li>Accommodates tubes from 0.5 &ndash; 50mL</li>\r\n<li>Color-coded insert.</li>\r\n<li>Easy release tabs for quick insert change</li>\r\n<li>Small footprint (10 x 5 x 3 inches)</li>\r\n<li>Temp. Range: -90&deg;C to 122&deg;C</li>\r\n<li>Tiered rack design permits the simultaneous viewing of all tubes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>For inquiry please kindly email to : lisa@prolabios.com</strong></p>', 1, '741abd707b5b84b1b54337dd9a61355f.jpg', 0, 0, '2020-02-25 21:50:56', '', '', '', 0),
(45, 0, 63, 0, '|biomolecular|hospital-clinic|cosmetic|dairy|food|general-purpose|pharmaceutical|water|', 'e-Vac Aspiration System', '', '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">These compact waste systems are ideal for use with critical or dangerous liquids or supernatants, pathogens, or any class III or IV biohazard laboratories.</p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Quiet, oil-free membrane pump (range from &ndash;250 mm to 650 mm Hg). Once target vacuum is reached, pump automatically switches off and on again when vacuum pressure is applied - perfect for gentle aspiration of small plates and dishes, as well as rapid emptying of larger containers.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Easy-to-clean stainless steel housing is UV-resistant for use in laminar hoods.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">The bottles can be autoclaved for 20 minutes at 121&deg;C to prevent laboratory contamination.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Base units are illuminated by LED for visual check of waste levels in the bottle.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dual hydrophobic filters prevent liquids from reaching the pump housing and contaminating the system.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">E-Vac bottle is available with a 4-L PP bottle and lid with either barbed or with quick-release connectors for safe and convenient tubing connections and level detection sensor that automatically shuts the pump off when the bottle is full.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Safe Aspiration:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li><strong>Safe</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>4l PP bottle</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Secure waste system</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Quick connector and overfill sensor</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Stable and sturdy housing with LED light</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Ideal for work with biological safety cabinet (BSC)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img title=\"e-vac\" src=\"/content/photo/80d91e6849f401b55d068abd0aeaeee9.jpg\" alt=\"e-vac\" width=\"457\" height=\"170\" /></p>\r\n<p>Hand-E-Vac controller Set consisting of:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Hand-E-Vac hand operator for pipettes (A)</li>\r\n<li>Stable stand (B)</li>\r\n<li>Adapter for single disposable tip (C),</li>\r\n<li>8-channel disposable tip (D) and</li>\r\n<li>8 channel stainless steel needles (E)</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>Second bottle stands increase your flexibility.</p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 200px;\"><img title=\"e-vac 2\" src=\"/content/photo/8dda182711b535db689d14bc17a0285b.jpg\" alt=\"e-vac 2\" width=\"193\" height=\"184\" /></p>\r\n<p><strong>Ideal for:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Laboratories</li>\r\n<li>Research and development</li>\r\n<li>Chemical industry</li>\r\n<li>Pharmaceutical industry</li>\r\n<li>Hospitals</li>\r\n<li>Food industry, agro</li>\r\n<li>Universities, etc</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Dimensions:</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li>Bench top: 5 kg, 29x21x11.5 cm</li>\r\n<li>Packed : 8 kg, 35x30x25 cm</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Items</strong></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 98.021%; height: 138px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 30px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.2071%; text-align: center; height: 30px;\"><strong>Catalogue</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 65.3372%; text-align: center; height: 30px;\"><strong>Descriptions</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.142%; text-align: center; height: 30px;\"><strong>UoM</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.2071%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">AG.EV4000Q</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 65.3372%; height: 18px; text-align: justify;\">E-Vac with 4L Polypropylene Bottle, lid with quick release connectors, tubes, level detection cable</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 12.142%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">1 ea</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;