(49, 0, 62, 0, '|biomolecular|hospital-clinic|dairy|food|general-purpose|pharmaceutical|', 'Mini Dry Heat Incubator', '', '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The mini dry bath heating block is a micro-processor controlled heating block with semiconductor heating technology. It adapts onboard use, smart, light and convenient for movement, suit for any kind of occasions. Especially good for the incubation of the gel clot Lyophilized Amebocyte Lysate assay, Lyophilized Amebocyte Lysate chromogenic endpoint assay incubation.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Product Features</strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Unique designed. Smart and light, convenient movement, suit for various occasions.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">LCD simultaneously display setting and actual time and&nbsp;&nbsp;temperature. Temperature calibration function.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Automatic fault detection function with buzzer alarm.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">24V DC input power, built-in over-temperature protection device.</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Various of blocks for optional choice. Convenient for replacement. Easy cleaning and disinfection.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Ordering information</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Dry heat incubator (single module) - TAL-MT</li>\r\n<li>Dry heat incubator (single module with heating lid) - TAL-MTI</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Product technical parameters</strong></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 198px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 40.31%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\"><strong>Model</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 26.3566%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\"><strong>TAL-MT</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\"><strong>TAL-MTI</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\