(156, 39, 0, 'Cosmetic', '', '<p><strong>The cosmetic industry</strong> is required to assess the microbiological quality of all raw materials, the production environment and final cosmetic products.</p>\r\n<p>Within the high profile, expanding cosmetics industry, extreme vigilance of microbial contamination is critical to prevent both product and economic losses, as well as protect the consumer against microbial risk.</p>\r\n<p>We offers solutions for often challenging analysis within the cosmetics industry. We can help with solutions for a wide range of requirements such as sterility, bioburden, environmental monitoring and determining antimicrobial and preservative effectiveness.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Culture media and reagent for cosmetics analysis</strong></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 93.8101%; height: 731px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 23.3029%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\"><strong>Parameter</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 7.48152%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\"><strong>Catalogue</strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 41.2497%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\"><strong>Product</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 23.3029%; text-align: center; height: 190px;\" rowspan=\"11\"><br /><strong><br /></strong><strong><br /></strong><strong><br /></strong><strong>Aerobic Microorganism Plate Count</strong><strong><br /></strong><strong><br /></strong><strong><br /></strong><strong><br /></strong><strong><br /></strong><strong><br /></strong></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 7.48152%; text-align: center; height: 10px;\">610036</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 41.2497%; height: 10px;\">Nutrient Agar</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 7.48152%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\">610094</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 41.2497%; height: 18px;\">MICROBIAL CONTENT Test Agar Base</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<t