ording to USP/EP/JP.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.5309%; text-align: center; height: 36px;\" width=\"64\">610396</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 29.1417%; height: 36px;\" width=\"584\">Mineral Modified Glutamate Medium</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.3273%; height: 36px;\">Liquid selective enrichment medium for the enumeration of <em>Escherichia coli</em>, according to ISO 16649.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.5309%; text-align: center; height: 36px;\" width=\"64\">610199</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 29.1417%; height: 36px;\" width=\"584\">m-CP Agar Base</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.3273%; height: 36px;\">Selective medium for isolation and enumeration of <em>Clostridium perfringens</em> in water, according to Council Directive 98/83/EC.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.5309%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\" width=\"64\">611011</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 29.1417%; height: 18px;\" width=\"584\">m-ENDO Agar LES</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.3273%; height: 18px;\">Medium for enumerating coliforms in water by membrane filtration technique, according to APHA.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.5309%; text-align: center; height: 36px;\" width=\"64\">610220</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 29.1417%; height: 36px;\" width=\"584\">m-ENDO Broth</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.3273%; height: 36px;\">Selective medium for coliforms enumeration in water by the membrane filter method.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.5309%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\" width=\"64\">611012</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 29.1417%; height: 18px;\" width=\"584\">m-FC Agar Base</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 56.3273%; height: 18px;\">Selective basal medium for fecal coliforms isolation and enumeration from water by the membrane filter technique.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 14.5309%; tex